Your resume must demonstrate at least one year of specialized experience equivalent to the next lower grade level (GS-12) or pay band in the federal service or equivalent experience in the private or public sector demonstrating the following: (1) Applying advanced theories, principles, and techniques of logistics management to function as a technical authority in aircraft weapon system product support management;
(2) Demonstrated job experience and understanding of aircraft weapon system life-cycle phases and documentation, planning, analysis and reviews associated with those phases;
(3) Formulating support and maintenance concepts and maintainability requirements for an aircraft weapon system;
